WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.126
Hi — I'm Jason. Welcome to Sage Ideas.

00:03.126 --> 00:05.422
AI is showing up in everything right now.

00:05.422 --> 00:11.706
The trouble is, a lot of it ships on a demo and a prayer — and a customer finds the one thing it gets wrong.

00:11.706 --> 00:15.303
So we build both halves: the AI feature you actually want…

00:15.303 --> 00:21.494
…and the proof it works — evals, tests, and gates that turn “trust me” into a number you can see.

00:21.494 --> 00:26.252
I've spent thirteen years in software quality, at The Home Depot and in fintech.

00:26.252 --> 00:30.213
Today I build and run two live products entirely on my own.

00:30.213 --> 00:37.619
Teams bring me three kinds of work: LLM & RAG evaluation, test automation & CI, and workflow automation.

00:37.619 --> 00:41.766
We start with a one-week audit — you leave with a plan either way.

00:41.766 --> 00:45.085
If there's an AI feature you're not sure about, let's talk.

00:45.085 --> 00:49.804
Book a free call. Thanks for watching — welcome to Sage Ideas.

